# Docker build context is agents/ (see agents/go/Dockerfile). Keep it small: the image
# only needs go/{go.mod,go.sum,**/*.go} and data/ — everything else is noise.
# Disposable runtime state. Never build an image around a developer's local database:
# agents/data is the immutable seed, and /app/state starts empty in every image.
**/.state/

# Build artifacts and local env.
**/bin/
**/coverage.out
**/.env
**/.adk/
